msgid "Web Portal"
msgstr "网页门户"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:5
msgid ""
"Click the Portal – \"My Files\" Link for the default Cluster Admin to "
"view his files/folders over the web portal:"
msgstr "点击门户网站 - \"我的文件\" 链接以便默认集群管理员通过网络门户查看他的文件/文件夹："

#: ../../chapter04.rst:9
msgid "See below image for the files and folder view:"
msgstr "请参见下图以查看文件和文件夹视图："

#: ../../chapter04.rst:13
msgid ""
"From here you can test the installation by creating files, migrating, "
"editing, sharing and deleting files to verify the storage setup is "
"working as expected."
msgstr "在此您可以通过创建文件、迁移、编辑、共享和删除文件来测试安装是否按预期工作，以验证存储设置是否正常。"

